{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"b9dc1e72-c4a6-4fca-859a-3b7f424fbf85","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The upgrade of the app to the current Pollar SDK (`0.12.0`) is complete. All changes have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-GsVisO/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Package Bump ([package.json](file:///tmp/h-GsVisO/package.json), [package-lock.json](file:///tmp/h-GsVisO/package-lock.json))**:\n   - Upgraded `@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` from `^0.10.1` to `^0.12.0`.\n2. **Config Endpoint ([src/pollar.ts](file:///tmp/h-GsVisO/src/pollar.ts))**:\n   - Removed the pinned path `/v1` from `baseUrl`: updated from `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz/v1'` to `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz'`.\n3. **Null Balance Handling ([src/balances.ts](file:///tmp/h-GsVisO/src/balances.ts))**:\n   - Handled `WalletBalanceRecord.balance` being `string | null` by displaying `'unavailable'` when `balance === null`, rather than converting to a number or defaulting to zero.\n4. **KYC Status ([src/kyc.ts](file:///tmp/h-GsVisO/src/kyc.ts))**:\n   - Added handling for the `'expired'` state in `kycMessage()`.\n5. **Trustline Sponsorship ([src/trust.ts](file:///tmp/h-GsVisO/src/trust.ts))**:\n   - Removed the obsolete `{ sponsored: true }` parameter from `client.setTrustline(USDC)`.\n6. **Ramps Quote Migration ([src/ramp.ts](file:///tmp/h-GsVisO/src/ramp.ts))**:\n   - Replaced `client.getRampsQuote()` with `client.quoteRamp()` and calculated the rate as `parseFloat(best.amountIn) / parseFloat(best.amountOut)` (pesos per USDC), returning `null` when no quotes exist.\n\n### Verification\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` runs with 0 errors.\n","duration_seconds":337.160659,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":365255,"output_tokens":8386,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":2066443,"total_tokens":373641}}}
